message: >-
  This repository currently contains a research protocol rather than a
  published result. Cite the archived release associated with any future paper.
title: "Ambiguity Is Not Conflict"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Meng
    given-names: Karl
repository-code: "https://github.com/DearKarl/ambiguity-is-not-conflict"
abstract: >-
  Protocol and reproducibility scaffold for identifying cross-modal conflict
  separately from unimodal ambiguity and evaluating calibrated selective
  decisions in medical image--text systems.
